        a sci:Proposition ;
        skos:prefLabel "A multi-cycle follicular cohort is sufficient to reproduce the menstrual cycle's 2–4-cycle length memory (within-cycle/hourglass noise is not), and the matching cohort timescale points to follicular folliculogenesis — a model sufficiency result, not in-vivo identification" ;
